# Netlify-style headers file, honored by git-pages (Codeberg Pages) and
# similar static hosts. mGBA-wasm creates a WebAssembly.Memory with
# shared:true (Web Threads), which only exists on cross-origin isolated
# pages — without these headers the emulator fails to boot.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
